:: Mine Job Cleaning Intro
<<effects>>

The <<person>> shoves a bundle of rags into your hands. "Clean this place up," <<he>> says before slumping back in <<his>> chair.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Cleaning
<<effects>>

You're in the guards' quarters. Rough figures enter and leave.
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	They openly stare at your <<lewdness>>.
<</if>>
<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<generate1>>
	You clutch your stomach and fall to your knees. A <<person1>><<person>> notices. <<He>> rushes to your side, and you feel <<him>> catch you as your consciousness fades.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Birth]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	You've pushed yourself too much.
	<br><br>

	<<passout>>
	<<link [[Everything fades to black...|Mine Job Cleaning Passout]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif Time.hour lte 5 or Time.hour gte 21>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning End]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Focus on cleaning (1:00)|Mine Job Cleaning Events]]>><<pass 1 hours>><<set $phase to 0>><<tiredness 3>><</link>><<gtiredness>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Pretend to clean (1:00)|Mine Job Cleaning Events]]>><<pass 1 hours>><<set $phase to 1>><<stress 3>><</link>><<gstress>>
	<br>
<</if>>



:: Mine Job Cleaning End
<<effects>><<generate1>>

A <<person1>><<person>> looks at <<his>> watch, and walks up to you. "Day's over," <<he>> says. <<He>> pulls you out of the cave and shoves you into a group of slaves.
<br><br>
You walk with them until you reach a metal gate, leading to a small cave. The group filters through, and the guard slams it shut.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Cleaning Events
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 0>>
	You focus on cleaning.
	<<if random(1,3) is 1>>
		<span class="green">You think you're getting better at this.<<housekeeping 2>><<ghousekeeping>></span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<print either(
		"You scrub off caked-on dust.",
		"You get a faceful of dust as you wipe off a shelf. It gets in your mouth and eyes, and you cough. <<pain 10>><<ggpain>> ",
		"You sweep up a broken bottle off the floor.",
		"You sop up a puddle on the floor.",
		"You clear trash off of one of the tables.",
		"You scrub boot prints off the floor."
	)>>
<<else>>
	You pretend to clean, and keep out of sight of the guards. You hope the guards don't notice.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<cleareventpool>>

<<addinlineevent "dress_up">>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	You notice a guard staring at you from the corner of the room. You pay <<him>> no mind as you continue.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> stands and walks over to a bunk, crouches, and pulls a box out from under it. 
	<<if !$mine.job.cleaning.chemical>>
		"Hey you," <<he>> says, opening the box and <span class="blue">revealing a black bottle tucked in a pile of clothing.</span>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		"Hey you," <<he>> says, opening the box and revealing a pile of clothing.
	<</if>>
	<<He>> pulls out a sundress. "Put this on," <<he>> barks.
	<br><br>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>>
	<<if !$mine.job.cleaning.chemical>><<link [[Steal the bottle|Mine Job Cleaning Sundress]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Just put it on|Mine Job Cleaning Sundress]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if !$mine.setup.food>>
	<<addinlineevent "food_sabotage">>
		<<generate1>>
		A <<person1>><<person>> shouts at you, "Hey! Get me a bowl of soup."
		<br><br>
		You walk to the pot.
		<<if $mine.job.cleaning.chemical is 1>>
			<span class="blue">An idea strikes you, you could pour the chemicals you found into the pot.</span>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Pour the chemicals in|Mine Job Cleaning Pot]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Fill a bowl|Mine Job Cleaning Pot]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "corner">>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	A <<person>> puts <<his>> arm around your waist, and tries to steer you towards a dark corner.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Go quietly|Mine Job Cleaning Corner]]>><<stress 6>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<gstress>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Pull away|Mine Job Cleaning Corner]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 1 15000>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "kiss">>
	<<generate1>>
	You notice a <<person1>><<person>> watching, <<his>> gaze focused on your lips. You try to ignore <<him>>, but <<he>> approaches, wraps <<his>> arm around your waist, then leans in for a kiss.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Endure|Mine Job Cleaning Kiss]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><</link>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Pull away|Mine Job Cleaning Kiss]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "beer">>
	<<generate1>><<generate2>>
	<<if $skulduggery gte 300>>
		You notice the guards closing in, and a <<person1>><<person>> preparing to grab you. <span class="green">You're able to move out of the way in time.</span> The <<person>> collides with another guard.
		<br><br>
		"Looks like the <<bitch>> doesn't want <<pher>> medicine," a <<person2>><<person>> laughs. They leave you be, for now.
	<<else>>
		A <<person1>><<person>> and <<person2>><<person>> accost you, the latter holding a funnel and bottle of beer.
		<br><br>
		"Open up. It's time for your medicine," <<he>> laughs. Rough hands force your mouth open as the <<person>> shoves the funnel into your mouth. You feel warm liquid pour down your throat, and manage to swallow it all. <<drunk 180>><<ggdrunk>>
		<br><br>
		They pull the funnel away, and the hands restraining your body retreat. You're left coughing on the ground as the guards return to what they were doing. <<pain 10>><<ggpain>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if !$mine.setup.map>>
	<<addinlineevent "map">>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		A <<person>> starts watching you from across the room. You averts your eyes and continue, then notice a piece of paper, half-concealed behind a pin-up.
		<br><br>
		<<if $history gte 300>>
			<<set $mine.setup.map to 1>>
			<span class="green">It's an old map of the tunnels!</span> You can't take it while the guard is watching.
		<<else>>
			Some odd lines cover it, <span class="red">but you can't get a better look while the guard is watching.</span> <span class="blue">Maybe a glimpse would be enough to figure it out, if you were better at history.</span>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "nothing" 1.5>>
	You go on without interruption.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "scream" 1.5>>
	A scream echoes through the tunnels. One of the guards chuckles. <<stress 10>><<trauma 5>><<ggstress>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "explosion" 1.5>>
	The rumbling of a distant explosion threatens your footing, but you manage to remain stood. <<stress 10>><<ggstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if $mine.favor.job.night is "firework" and $mine.favor.night isnot 1>>
	<<addinlineevent "firework">>
		<<generate1>>
		A <<person1>><<person>> smacks the back of a chair. "Fix this. It's all wobbly."
		<br><br>
		You walk over and put a piece of wood underneath the short leg to balance it. <span class="blue">You could set off the fireworks now.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Set off the fireworks|Mine Job Cleaning Firework]]>><<set $mine.favor.night to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Just leave|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

